## Why This Matters

In modern training pipelines:

- Checkpoints can be tens of GiBs
- Written every few minutes
- Blocking application progress

This leads to:

- GPU idle time during checkpoint writes  
- Longer end-to-end training duration  
- Higher infrastructure cost  

AIFS addresses this by:

- Writing checkpoints at **NVMe speed**
- Decoupling application latency from backend storage
- Asynchronously draining data to persistent storage  

---

## What the Calculator Does

The AIFS Pricing Calculator converts infrastructure performance into **business value**.

### Inputs

- Checkpoint size (GiB)
- Checkpoint interval (minutes)
- Training duration (hours)
- Number of nodes and GPUs
- Baseline storage performance (disk / ANF / custom)
- AIFS throughput and cache VM cost

---

### Outputs

#### 1. Checkpoint Performance
- Time per checkpoint (before vs after AIFS)
- Percentage reduction in checkpoint latency

#### 2. GPU Efficiency
- Idle time reduction
- GPU-hours saved per run
- Monthly GPU-hours saved

#### 3. Cost Impact
- GPU cost savings
- Storage right-sizing savings
- Net monthly value

#### 4. Pricing Guidance
- Suggested license based on value capture (10–20%)
- Cost per node and per GPU

